<main class="lg">
  <h1>Subprocessors</h1>
  <p class="lg-updated">Last updated November 15, 2026</p>
  <p>These are the outside services that store or process school data for Managira, each under a written agreement to use it only to provide its service and to protect it. Services marked "when a school turns it on" receive data only from schools that use that feature. We update this list before a new service receives student data.</p>
  <div class="lg-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>What it does for Managira</th><th>Data it receives</th><th>Location</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Render</td><td>Hosting for the application and its database</td><td>All service data</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Amazon Web Services</td><td>File storage and encrypted backups</td><td>Uploaded and generated files, backups</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Namecheap Private Email</td><td>Sending email (sign-in codes, notices, report cards)</td><td>The recipient's address and the message</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Stripe</td><td>Card and bank payments, when a school uses Billing &amp; Payments (PayGira)</td><td>Payer details (Managira stores no card numbers)</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Twilio</td><td>Text messages, when a school turns them on</td><td>Phone number and message</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Meta (WhatsApp)</td><td>WhatsApp messages, when a school turns them on</td><td>Phone number and message</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Anthropic, OpenAI</td><td>Mira, the staff assistant, when a school turns it on (never for parents or students)</td><td>A staff member's question and the records Mira looks up for them; their terms exclude training on this data</td><td>United States</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Google, Microsoft</td><td>Google Classroom and calendar connections a school or person turns on</td><td>Only what that feature needs</td><td>United States</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>Questions about how a service handles data can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@managira.com">info@managira.com</a>. Our commitments are in the <a href="/legal/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, and security reports go to <a href="/legal/security">security@managira.com</a>.</p>
